ce that, in the last step, we simplified the right-hand side using ${cos}^{2}⁡t+{sin}^{2}⁡t=1.$ \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡t(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-1)+{cos}^{2}⁡t=1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-65225/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ec62fd08-5729-5dc4-97b9-1a422f70109e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-65225"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-65222/selection/667d744fad497b265cbb8cc7525c51b1da8135daf73f1eb50a719b8fd7a76e69" :answer/id #uuid "4ecd62f0-49bc-5e45-97a8-03eb2f64a727" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65222/selection/5b30f4671c5d62fc7ff7d355bc17b6e023cd6892d3dd3b475396c0539fcbc379" :answer/id #uuid "44e581b8-8048-5bc7-8a56-245755d886cf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65222/selection/f36da994b0f84487f809ebda294bf1da3fa872203d9e5d80fdc869e49ff976fb" :answer/id #uuid "5a1471e9-dbe1-5ad1-a1ce-8cb57d144fc9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65222/selection/5ce40fe79eaec1bfc80a3845360e1812a64bc9629ca427fa0bd76c62d624ad30" :answer/id #uuid "104d1683-cef5-5b73-9cbe-7ab946b00322" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65222/selection/adea6de6de33b77366fb56ce5e7c5bea8e168241aa8eb80c0701b0fec906ee66" :answer/id #uuid "845a29ad-7cbf-5c9b-96e8-b9af821f49e3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65222/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "913666bc-6e16-5a47-bfc0-f08a87654960" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-65222/selection/f36da994b0f84487f809ebda294bf1da3fa872203d9e5d80fdc869e49ff976fb" :answer-field/choices ["q-65222/selection/667d744fad497b265cbb8cc7525c51b1da8135daf73f1eb50a719b8fd7a76e69" "q-65222/selection/5b30f4671c5d62fc7ff7d355bc17b6e023cd6892d3dd3b475396c0539fcbc379" "q-65222/selection/f36da994b0f84487f809ebda294bf1da3fa872203d9e5d80fdc869e49ff976fb" "q-65222/selection/5ce40fe79eaec1bfc80a3845360e1812a64bc9629ca427fa0bd76c62d624ad30" "q-65222/selection/adea6de6de33b77366fb56ce5e7c5bea8e168241aa8eb80c0701b0fec906ee66"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-65222" :question/id #uuid "2cd9b6ea-7f4c-565f-a1df-e0c0764d8805" :question/math-academy-id "q-65222" :question/problem "Simplify the trigonometric expression $\\operatorname{cos}⁡t(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)-{sin}^{2}⁡t.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we expand the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)-{sin}^{2}⁡t & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-{cos}^{2}⁡t-{sin}^{2}⁡t \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-({cos}^{2}⁡t+{sin}^{2}⁡t) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that, in the last step, we simplified the right-hand side using ${cos}^{2}⁡t+{sin}^{2}⁡t=1.$ \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡t(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)-{sin}^{2}⁡t=\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-1.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-65222/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ec62fd08-5729-5dc4-97b9-1a422f70109e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-65222"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-43288/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "18cbc9e0-efb2-55ee-a6e5-b7bdc5d0c084" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-43288/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "ff092e9a-2faa-58d2-8b89-f5a29ef55324" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:an