ac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }+\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta {cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }+\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }}+\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }} \\\\  & ={cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that, in the last step, we simplified the right-hand side using ${cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta =1.$ \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta (\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }+\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta })=1.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-43288/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ec62fd08-5729-5dc4-97b9-1a422f70109e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-43288"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-43293/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "f720f87e-ee42-5d38-8375-28d6f4a924f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-43293/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "545aa608-c44d-569c-8fc8-7d60506d36c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-43293/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id 