me{sin}⁡t\\cdot ({cos}^{2}⁡t+{sin}^{2}⁡t)}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t}\n$$\n\nNext, we use the Pythagorean identity to rewrite the expression in the parentheses, and then we simplify the resulting expression as much as possible.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\cdot ({cos}^{2}⁡t+{sin}^{2}⁡t)}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t} & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\cdot 1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡t}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡t{cos}^{2}⁡t+{sin}^{3}⁡t}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t}=\\operatorname{tan}⁡t.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-65246/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "868125f0-22e0-57fc-9620-f3242419a689"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-65246"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-65249/selection/fbdfea5b1daf4d74b7704516814c3c28369f5bc5063ac90d7a612b0fa0bb5de8" :answer/id #uuid "74a10c15-ba27-58d9-b6fa-363a55b245dc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65249/selection/c71175ea6862258220ad3e13d5ea0d3d89386f7fef9e6c7774e0dc3ab41cce44" :answer/id #uuid "d68b9176-487c-54ac-9e92-1343b6c283ab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65249/selection/19599ec0b6f7be72ec48d28a49c620e3a67678a08c03ad5cebd5e852c084720f" :answer/id #uuid "f85a2ef9-e633-58fd-9a74-01bb6cdd3e73" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65249/selection/a0332b537f4486805ad1793740b0a1ac4165eaeb48e40facdc78c5de1981c15a" :answer/id #uuid "99f12ab1-43f0-545e-9116-e7f3d5139227" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65249/selection/f5144485a8a6aa0005c82db9e56