rac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta {cos}^{3}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta {sin}^{3}⁡\\theta }=\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta .\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-65248/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "868125f0-22e0-57fc-9620-f3242419a689"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-65248"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-72712/selection/09d3fee19442b303e5d29ccd6c0dcde64c26e425ca8130d4a36a2f7a903e6b85" :answer/id #uuid "652a519e-6044-55c9-b687-0eaf451aa4e8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{tan}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72712/selection/c8dad4a4816670170f9b6aa4ae426d27d22c81303f4d585d901467dd3506e876" :answer/id #uuid "b183d013-5c59-545c-b71e-05d9cedefb80" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+\\operatorname{sec}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72712/selection/7de09e747f7722e95bd0a970426bbfa02fc4e65ef0be81f1629cfef16151bed1" :answer/id #uuid "4c790421-55f1-5db7-ab84-46756901b08d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+\\operatorname{sec}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72712/selection/3fc8f46aa6f5fae9599fe94860e837621c3a567ba978228e96368b5889b2f335" :answer/id #uuid "4d3a48f8-a132-58be-9a77-da5d9e88636a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{tan}⁡x-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72712/selection/2b8e5d762c260e1725d44912a985c3137c3bbf5c9acb717042c9e4e630085439" :answer/id #uuid "fe24a001-2ae3-5a28-96d0-c946472cf018" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72712/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ebca33b5-a1ca-561d-a53a-a7f4a65957ca" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-72712/selection/c8dad4a4816670170f9b6aa4ae426d27d22c81303f4d585d901467dd3506e876" :answer-field/choices ["q-72712/selection/09d3fee19442b303e5d29ccd6c0dcde64c26e425ca8130d4a36a2f7a903e6b85" "q-72712/selection/c8dad4a4816670170f9b6aa4ae426d27d22c81303f4d585d901467dd3506e876" "q-72712/selection/7de09e747f7722e95bd0a970426bbfa02fc4e65ef0be81f1629cfef16151bed1" "q-72712/selection/3fc8f46aa6f5fae9599fe94860e837621c3a567ba978228e96368b5889b2f335" "q-72712/selection/2b8e5d762c260e1725d44912a985c3137c3bbf5c9acb717042c9e4e630085439"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-72712" :question/id #uuid "2f4cf1a9-f966-55f5-ad06-7ce4a1647800" :question/math-academy-id "q-72712" :question/problem "Simplify the trigonometric expression $\\frac{{sin}^{3}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x{cos}^{2}⁡x+1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we factor $\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ from the first two terms:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{sin}^{3}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x{cos}^{2}⁡x+1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x({sin}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x)+1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\n$$\n\nNext, we use the Pythagorean identity to rewrite the expression in the parentheses, and then we simplify the resulting expression as much as possible:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x({sin}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x)+1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x} & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}+\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we conclude that:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{sin}^{3}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x{cos}^{2}⁡x+1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}=\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\n$$" :question/difficulty :q